1
00:00:04,720 --> 00:00:05,897
It's my life.

2
00:00:05,980 --> 00:00:06,917
It's your life.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:08,157
Fighting for tomorrow.

4
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:12,080
Go get what you really want.
I want more. Any one more.

5
00:00:12,240 --> 00:00:13,797
Come on, open up the door.

6
00:00:13,880 --> 00:00:16,060
It's my life. It's your life.

7
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,737
Run like the wind, jump high.

8
00:00:17,820 --> 00:00:18,650
Yeah, yeah, yeah.

9
00:00:18,733 --> 00:00:19,760
I know you're strong.

10
00:00:20,180 --> 00:00:22,137
Believe you can achieve your goal.

11
00:00:22,220 --> 00:00:24,660
Let's keep on going on the stage.

12
00:00:44,400 --> 00:00:45,577
Let's do it again.

13
00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:47,437
You know what I mean, baby!

14
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,937
Know what you're making my dream, time to?

15
00:00:50,020 --> 00:00:51,260
Don't you feel it?

16
00:00:51,360 --> 00:00:55,197
I really don't know what is
Something is testing me every day.

17
00:00:55,280 --> 00:00:56,497
Hey, let's go.

18
00:00:56,580 --> 00:00:57,457
Let's fly away.

19
00:00:57,540 --> 00:01:00,557
I know I never wanna come back here.

20
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,837
Hey, let's go.

21
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,437
Let's fly away the crazy.

22
00:01:03,520 --> 00:01:05,377
I know there are no rules.

23
00:01:05,460 --> 00:01:07,437
Standing up, blowing up.

24
00:01:07,520 --> 00:01:09,297
My dream is getting wild.

25
00:01:09,380 --> 00:01:12,597
I'm not afraid, beat me, hit me.

26
00:01:12,680 --> 00:01:15,137
I will never turn around.

27
00:01:15,220 --> 00:01:17,917
Another day, another chance.

28
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:20,117
You know it's never too late.

29
00:01:20,200 --> 00:01:22,357
If I can do it, so can you.

30
00:01:22,440 --> 00:01:23,540
Only without.

31
00:01:26,420 --> 00:01:28,477
It's my life, it's your life.

32
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:31,557
But if you don't want to
get what you really want.

33
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:33,657
I want more, anyone more.

34
00:01:33,740 --> 00:01:35,580
Come on, open up the door.

35
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,917
It's my life, it's your life.

36
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,937
Run like the wind, jump high, yeah, yeah.

37
00:01:41,020 --> 00:01:42,717
I know you're strong.

38
00:01:42,800 --> 00:01:45,077
Believe you cannot achieve your goal.

39
00:01:45,160 --> 00:01:47,037
Let's keep on going, rolling.

40
00:01:47,120 --> 00:01:49,357
It's my life, it's your life.

41
00:01:49,440 --> 00:01:52,437
Fighting for your wife that I
want, but you're where it was.

42
00:01:52,520 --> 00:01:57,337
I want more, anyone more,
come on, open up the gate.

43
00:01:57,420 --> 00:02:01,557
It's my life, it's your life,
shine like a star to be good.

44
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:06,257
I know you're strong, just
that you gotta keep your best.

45
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:08,800
Let's keep on going, I'm not dead.

46
00:02:15,680 --> 00:02:19,020
You make my day every day.

47
00:02:33,040 --> 00:02:34,280
Are you crazy?

48
00:02:34,580 --> 00:02:35,580
You're gonna pay!

49
00:02:35,840 --> 00:02:37,697
This voice is a real sensitive issue!

50
00:02:37,780 --> 00:02:40,780
Fuck it off or he's gonna
flip out and kill us too!

51
00:02:55,880 --> 00:03:00,037
Brace yourselves, because we're about to
get punched by a whole freaking castle!

52
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:02,473
I can feel that there's trouble looming.

53
00:03:02,760 --> 00:03:04,520
Admiral, a monster is coming!

54
00:03:04,720 --> 00:03:06,014
We have to take cover!

55
00:03:07,380 --> 00:03:10,615
Luffy, you really gotta stop
screwing with every enemy!

56
00:03:11,160 --> 00:03:13,840
See, it's so hard not to crack up, huh?

57
00:03:14,220 --> 00:03:15,220
Damn, you too.

58
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:20,868
This ain't gonna be pretty!

59
00:04:04,300 --> 00:04:05,580
Where are we now?

60
00:04:06,380 --> 00:04:07,540
Like I'd know.

61
00:04:07,700 --> 00:04:10,288
Even further from the
palace, thanks to you.

62
00:04:12,140 --> 00:04:12,970
Damn it.

63
00:04:13,220 --> 00:04:15,317
That stone bastard's something else.

64
00:04:15,400 --> 00:04:18,937
Never thought we'd see someone
bigger than oars, but here we are.

65
00:04:19,020 --> 00:04:24,220
How am I supposed to even fight
something that size Straw Hat?

66
00:04:30,900 --> 00:04:37,420
Pirate hunter Zoro I
presume and you Trafalgar

67
00:04:39,960 --> 00:04:45,977
You disgusting worst generation scoundrel,
why do you steal all the glory from me?

68
00:04:46,060 --> 00:04:47,160
Stop yelling!

69
00:04:47,520 --> 00:04:49,357
Got to beef with my crewmate or something?

70
00:04:49,440 --> 00:04:50,675
I'm not in your crew!

71
00:04:50,840 --> 00:04:53,664
Let me guess, you still
got a grudge against us!

72
00:04:56,280 --> 00:04:57,110
You're wrong.

73
00:04:57,480 --> 00:05:00,304
I shall no longer be a
threat to the Straw Hats.

74
00:05:00,760 --> 00:05:01,590
Huh?

75
00:05:01,980 --> 00:05:04,300
Because your brave crewmate, God Usopp,

76
00:05:04,440 --> 00:05:07,297
selflessly saved me from
a life of doom and gloom.

77
00:05:07,380 --> 00:05:09,320
Usopp did that? That's right.

78
00:05:09,580 --> 00:05:11,462
I won't forget his valiant deed.

79
00:05:11,580 --> 00:05:15,580
He boldly risked everything in order
to spare the lives of hundreds.

80
00:05:16,060 --> 00:05:16,890
Ha!

81
00:05:16,973 --> 00:05:19,382
Chucks, it's nice to hear
you compliment my crew!

82
00:05:19,760 --> 00:05:20,680
Oh, right.

83
00:05:24,780 --> 00:05:26,839
Trafalgar, I believe this is yours.

84
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:29,649
I happened upon it
outside of the Coliseum.

85
00:05:29,780 --> 00:05:31,898
I'm sure you've been longing for it.

86
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:33,588
Lend me your head a second.

87
00:05:34,360 --> 00:05:35,537
Get away from me!

88
00:05:35,620 --> 00:05:36,679
I don't trust you!

89
00:05:37,200 --> 00:05:38,030
Hmph.

90
00:05:38,113 --> 00:05:41,557
Like I'd waste any more time on
you, I have a schedule to maintain.

91
00:05:41,640 --> 00:05:44,157
Aren't you going to
inquire why I'm so busy?

92
00:05:44,240 --> 00:05:45,070
I'm good.

93
00:05:45,153 --> 00:05:49,327
I have decided to repay my debt to your
crew by seizing the head of Doflamingo.

94
00:05:50,260 --> 00:05:51,160
The hell?

95
00:05:51,660 --> 00:05:53,997
Seek shelter in dirt or whatever you do.

96
00:05:54,080 --> 00:05:56,037
I shall handle these matters as tribute.

97
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:56,950
Yeah, no thanks.

98
00:05:57,033 --> 00:05:58,437
I'm going to do it myself.

99
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:02,177
I already decided this is how I'm going
to pay back Rebecca for buying me lunch.

100
00:06:02,260 --> 00:06:04,957
You're going head to head
with a warlord over some food?

101
00:06:05,040 --> 00:06:06,260
I won't fall for it.

102
00:06:06,520 --> 00:06:08,200
How dare you lie to my face?

103
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:12,297
You're just trying to take out Doflamingo
for the fame and riches that follow.

104
00:06:12,380 --> 00:06:13,857
That sounds like you, actually.

105
00:06:13,940 --> 00:06:15,680
Just ponder it a moment.

106
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:18,637
He who brings down the
dastardly ghost flamingo will

107
00:06:18,720 --> 00:06:21,877
make headlines ensuring the
whole world turns their head!

108
00:06:21,960 --> 00:06:24,372
Imagine the crowds clamoring to meet you!

109
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:27,270
Mr.

110
00:06:27,353 --> 00:06:29,081
Superstar Playboy extraordinaire!

111
00:06:29,840 --> 00:06:31,720
Just Superstar will suffice.

112
00:06:32,020 --> 00:06:33,300
No need to be formal.

113
00:06:34,320 --> 00:06:35,150
What is it?

114
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,840
Excuse me, sir.

115
00:06:37,020 --> 00:06:39,497
What's your opinion regarding
piracy in recent years?

116
00:06:39,580 --> 00:06:41,217
Oh, are you still there?

117
00:06:41,300 --> 00:06:42,829
I'm having trouble seeing!

118
00:06:43,140 --> 00:06:44,316
Lord Cavendish, sir?

119
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:45,638
What's the problem?

120
00:06:45,820 --> 00:06:47,820
I'm standing here in front of you.

121
00:06:48,200 --> 00:06:50,597
You're shining so bright we can't see you.

122
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:52,327
Can you turn down your aura?

123
00:06:52,760 --> 00:06:54,300
Is it too intense for you?

124
00:06:54,420 --> 00:06:57,217
I apologize, but I cannot
suppress my brilliance.

125
00:06:57,300 --> 00:06:59,200
Oh, he really is a superstar.

126
00:06:59,960 --> 00:07:00,790
All right.

127
00:07:01,500 --> 00:07:02,440
Time to go.

128
00:07:04,480 --> 00:07:07,860
Please feel free to bask
in my glory. Take it in.

129
00:07:08,080 --> 00:07:09,300
Take it all in.

130
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:20,040
What about here?

131
00:07:22,600 --> 00:07:24,840
Keep searching for Straw Hat's body.

132
00:07:25,060 --> 00:07:28,517
After a punch like that, he might
have been crushed to smithereens.

133
00:07:28,600 --> 00:07:30,220
Perhaps he got away.

134
00:07:37,560 --> 00:07:38,540
Find him!

135
00:07:38,780 --> 00:07:41,721
I need to know if the
little maggot's still alive!

136
00:07:42,480 --> 00:07:45,580
I'll squash you flat
before you get to Dopey!

137
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:51,080
There you are, Straw Hat!

138
00:07:52,200 --> 00:07:55,220
Get out of my way! Move! Move!

139
00:07:56,760 --> 00:07:58,417
You heard me go!

140
00:07:58,500 --> 00:07:59,640
I know that guy!

141
00:08:02,380 --> 00:08:04,540
Grandson of God, wait for me!

142
00:08:05,900 --> 00:08:08,417
We've been looking for you, rubber boy!

143
00:08:08,500 --> 00:08:09,757
Stay!

144
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:10,840
Stay right there!

145
00:08:14,480 --> 00:08:16,320
Ugh, not so!

146
00:08:16,740 --> 00:08:17,737
We're coming for you!

147
00:08:17,820 --> 00:08:19,480
We should go! Run!

148
00:08:20,020 --> 00:08:21,432
What's getting into you?

149
00:08:22,640 --> 00:08:24,860
But we told him to wait!

150
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:28,920
You've got more company?

151
00:08:31,500 --> 00:08:32,720
He's away already!

152
00:08:32,920 --> 00:08:34,440
Stop all of you!

153
00:08:34,920 --> 00:08:35,820
Head on!

154
00:08:41,960 --> 00:08:46,440
Is there something wrong with
your hearing, grandson of Garp?

155
00:08:55,020 --> 00:08:57,820
Just hear this old man out for a moment.

156
00:08:58,300 --> 00:09:02,737
I wanted to let you know I've forgiven
the grudge I held against your family.

157
00:09:02,820 --> 00:09:04,097
What? You did?

158
00:09:04,180 --> 00:09:09,420
We're here for one thing, and that's to
eliminate Doflamingo's immoral business.

159
00:09:10,060 --> 00:09:11,825
We don't care about the money.

160
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:15,360
A puny bounty like that
is mere change for us.

161
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:19,217
I must thank you and your friend for the

162
00:09:19,300 --> 00:09:22,580
brave god Usopp rescued
me in my darkest hour.

163
00:09:22,780 --> 00:09:23,780
Usopp did that?

164
00:09:23,940 --> 00:09:26,417
Decided to repay my debt
to the Straw Hats by

165
00:09:26,500 --> 00:09:31,180
obliterating Doflamingo and his
wicked monarchy. Huh? You two?

166
00:09:31,500 --> 00:09:33,960
The only guy who's kicking his ass is me.

167
00:09:37,860 --> 00:09:39,400
The nerve of you!

168
00:09:39,840 --> 00:09:42,260
Are you rejecting my generous favor?

169
00:09:44,080 --> 00:09:46,640
Straw Hat, I was searching for you.

170
00:09:47,020 --> 00:09:49,360
I say we buried a hatchet between us.

171
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:52,080
I swear as a proud warrior of Elbath,

172
00:09:52,800 --> 00:09:54,035
I'll slay Doflamingo!

173
00:09:54,320 --> 00:09:55,440
but guard Usopp.

174
00:09:55,620 --> 00:09:59,980
We of the Prodent's kingdom have
long owed King Rick an enormous debt.

175
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:03,540
I'll bring down Doflamingo
with my own two fists.

176
00:10:04,540 --> 00:10:06,700
Yes, his majesty's right.

177
00:10:07,080 --> 00:10:09,433
We don't want the bounty, not this time.

178
00:10:10,040 --> 00:10:11,000
Stand down.

179
00:10:11,200 --> 00:10:13,637
We will be the ones who kill that bastard.

180
00:10:13,720 --> 00:10:18,073
We shall never forget that beacon of
light, who freed us from our torment.

181
00:10:18,320 --> 00:10:21,340
Let us repay his valor. Wait!

182
00:10:22,120 --> 00:10:24,420
I won't let you do this without me!

183
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,948
Destruction's my specialty!

184
00:10:29,240 --> 00:10:31,520
You can leave the execution to me.

185
00:10:32,520 --> 00:10:33,460
Back off!

186
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:35,600
I'll be the one to take his life

187
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:39,037
You really attract some oddballs, huh?

188
00:10:39,120 --> 00:10:41,000
You'd be a fool to forget me.

189
00:10:44,200 --> 00:10:46,280
Great, Big Mouth found us again.

190
00:10:53,220 --> 00:10:55,100
Hey, what if we do it this way?

191
00:10:55,940 --> 00:11:01,100
Us two will handle killing Doflamingo
While you guys watch our backs, sound okay?

192
00:11:01,800 --> 00:11:02,760
Absolutely not!

193
00:11:03,080 --> 00:11:05,060
I'm going to kill Go Flamingo!

194
00:11:09,660 --> 00:11:10,490
Forget it.

195
00:11:10,680 --> 00:11:12,980
There are way too many egos involved.

196
00:11:13,640 --> 00:11:14,840
Come on, guys.

197
00:11:17,180 --> 00:11:19,577
Alright, I'm making
the call, so listen up!

198
00:11:19,660 --> 00:11:23,537
If anyone here's gonna kick his ass like
it needs to be kicked, it's gonna be me!

199
00:11:23,620 --> 00:11:24,620
What did you say?

200
00:11:25,260 --> 00:11:27,877
You're getting this favor
returned one way or another.

201
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,600
If you save someone's life,

202
00:11:29,720 --> 00:11:32,757
you better learn to accept their
kindness or else, you moron!

203
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:34,340
That's right! Guilty!

204
00:11:35,140 --> 00:11:35,970
Attention!

205
00:11:36,260 --> 00:11:37,200
My pride!

206
00:11:37,740 --> 00:11:38,570
The team!

207
00:11:38,900 --> 00:11:39,760
Ah, savior!

208
00:11:45,240 --> 00:11:46,380
The spear!

209
00:11:46,960 --> 00:11:48,800
So that's where they were!

210
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:51,934
Hey, you think we could get in on this?

211
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:56,059
Splitting up all those
bounties could go a long way!

212
00:11:57,260 --> 00:11:58,380
Wait a sec.

213
00:11:58,860 --> 00:12:00,737
Don't they look kind of familiar to you?

214
00:12:00,820 --> 00:12:02,917
They were toys at the dock just like us.

215
00:12:03,000 --> 00:12:05,097
Those shapeless cowards, how dare they?

216
00:12:05,180 --> 00:12:06,474
Let's get that bounty!

217
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:11,600
You ungrateful swine,
I'll see you in hell!

218
00:12:13,640 --> 00:12:15,160
Let's go. Yeah.

219
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:18,800
It's Lucy!

220
00:12:20,980 --> 00:12:21,940
A cow?

221
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:23,720
Got an idea.

222
00:12:33,020 --> 00:12:34,300
It can't be.

223
00:12:34,520 --> 00:12:35,360
Oh, bull!

224
00:12:38,660 --> 00:12:39,920
Go! Go!

225
00:12:41,800 --> 00:12:43,840
I've located the Straw Hats!

226
00:12:44,160 --> 00:12:45,580
Look, Master Pika!

227
00:12:45,860 --> 00:12:47,460
They came right to us!

228
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,740
Don't let them get away!

229
00:12:50,140 --> 00:12:51,434
They're riding a bull!

230
00:12:51,680 --> 00:12:53,033
I've got eyes on three.

231
00:12:55,580 --> 00:13:00,140
Wait, I mean, four, five, six, seven!

232
00:13:01,620 --> 00:13:03,020
Wait, Straw Hat!

233
00:13:03,320 --> 00:13:05,460
I said get lost!

234
00:13:06,640 --> 00:13:08,360
He brought an army?

235
00:13:09,120 --> 00:13:10,740
Where did they come from?

236
00:13:14,180 --> 00:13:15,800
I said I've got this!

237
00:13:15,900 --> 00:13:17,253
You all can stand down!

238
00:13:17,480 --> 00:13:18,320
That's enough!

239
00:13:18,620 --> 00:13:22,037
I won't hesitate to slice you all
into pieces if you get in my way!

240
00:13:22,120 --> 00:13:22,950
Wrong!

241
00:13:23,033 --> 00:13:25,180
That would be my privilege. No, mine!

242
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:27,757
How did he get so many
allies on such short notice?

243
00:13:27,840 --> 00:13:28,817
How should I know?

244
00:13:28,900 --> 00:13:32,135
Aren't those some of the
competitors from the Coliseum?

245
00:13:32,700 --> 00:13:35,500
I'll crush as many of you as it takes.

246
00:13:35,720 --> 00:13:36,600
Now die!

247
00:13:38,880 --> 00:13:39,900
Here we go.

248
00:13:40,260 --> 00:13:41,380
Drill Dragon!

249
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:49,100
Although I'm not fully charged up
yet, I got a light one for you.

250
00:13:54,320 --> 00:13:55,920
King Punch!

251
00:13:56,520 --> 00:13:57,350
Nailed!

252
00:13:57,433 --> 00:13:58,263
Here I go!

253
00:14:12,520 --> 00:14:14,520
They shattered his arm!

254
00:14:14,860 --> 00:14:19,197
We can consider this our practice round
for when we finally get to Doflamingo,

255
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:20,110
right?

256
00:14:20,193 --> 00:14:21,220
Oh, Moose off!

257
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:22,340
I said I got it!

258
00:14:23,580 --> 00:14:24,580
Shut up!

259
00:14:24,720 --> 00:14:26,620
You ungrateful savior!

260
00:14:27,000 --> 00:14:29,100
I don't need your help!

261
00:14:34,180 --> 00:14:35,480
I hope that's done.

262
00:14:35,640 --> 00:14:38,380
That serves you right,
you big whiny brood.

263
00:14:39,720 --> 00:14:40,940
That was close!

264
00:14:42,040 --> 00:14:43,220
Yeah, giddy up!

265
00:14:43,380 --> 00:14:45,140
Go, Moosey! Easy, boy.

266
00:14:45,440 --> 00:14:46,917
We're all counting on you.

267
00:14:47,000 --> 00:14:49,420
Hey, I told you, you're not invited.

268
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,120
Get off of Moosey!

269
00:14:51,260 --> 00:14:52,237
Oh, please reconsider.

270
00:14:52,320 --> 00:14:53,620
We're already here.

271
00:14:53,940 --> 00:14:56,440
Yeah, Straw Hat, let us in on the fun.

272
00:14:56,760 --> 00:14:58,580
Come on, Moosey, tell him.

273
00:15:00,700 --> 00:15:03,720
Where is the gistice
one, you little bastard?

274
00:15:03,900 --> 00:15:05,757
Hey, don't let them get through.

275
00:15:05,840 --> 00:15:08,193
They're heading straight for the palace.

276
00:15:10,480 --> 00:15:11,780
Let me jump in.

277
00:15:11,880 --> 00:15:13,645
Giddy-o, the champion fighter!

278
00:15:15,380 --> 00:15:16,851
Straw Hat's getting away.

279
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:18,620
Forget about me already?

280
00:15:19,340 --> 00:15:20,420
Destruction King!

281
00:15:22,260 --> 00:15:26,077
Better send in some big guns,
otherwise there's no stopping me!

282
00:15:26,160 --> 00:15:27,560
These guys are crazy!

283
00:15:30,380 --> 00:15:31,660
Commodore Olympus!

284
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,744
If I were you, I'd get
out of my way, Commodore!

285
00:15:38,320 --> 00:15:39,280
Shoot him!

286
00:15:41,100 --> 00:15:43,800
Blade of Beauty, Swan Lake!

287
00:15:57,940 --> 00:15:59,700
there's trouble on the way.

288
00:16:00,840 --> 00:16:03,100
he's gonna throw another one.

289
00:16:05,440 --> 00:16:06,457
not again?

290
00:16:06,540 --> 00:16:07,657
it's round two.

291
00:16:07,740 --> 00:16:08,897
i wouldn't do it.

292
00:16:08,980 --> 00:16:11,397
you obviously don't know
what you're dealing with.

293
00:16:11,480 --> 00:16:14,637
here his arms grow back even
if you break him ten times.

294
00:16:14,720 --> 00:16:15,997
stop wasting energy.

295
00:16:16,080 --> 00:16:16,910
what are you?

296
00:16:16,993 --> 00:16:17,823
suggest we do?

297
00:16:17,906 --> 00:16:22,277
i say we flee.

298
00:16:22,360 --> 00:16:24,837
you're a paid professional.

299
00:16:24,920 --> 00:16:26,397
you really got nothing else.

300
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:28,377
retreating is a valid strategy.

301
00:16:28,460 --> 00:16:29,297
you want to live?

302
00:16:29,380 --> 00:16:30,210
don't you?

303
00:16:36,820 --> 00:16:38,937
running at him head on is not viable.

304
00:16:39,020 --> 00:16:40,317
let's take a detour.

305
00:16:40,400 --> 00:16:42,797
how do we get through him?

306
00:16:42,880 --> 00:16:45,317
we won't make it to the
palace at this rate.

307
00:16:45,400 --> 00:16:48,200
Where did Straw Hat run off to, huh?

308
00:16:48,300 --> 00:16:49,476
I lost sight of him.

309
00:16:49,640 --> 00:16:51,500
He may have been pulverized.

310
00:16:52,540 --> 00:16:53,800
There he is!

311
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,300
Yee-haw!

312
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,620
Good boy!

313
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:03,900
Go, go, go!

314
00:17:05,420 --> 00:17:07,100
He's going up there!

315
00:17:07,640 --> 00:17:08,540
Let's go!

316
00:17:09,640 --> 00:17:10,470
Mercy!

317
00:17:16,960 --> 00:17:17,980
No way!

318
00:17:18,380 --> 00:17:19,620
He's gone crazy!

319
00:17:19,820 --> 00:17:21,200
He can't upstage me!

320
00:17:22,520 --> 00:17:24,180
Didn't expect that.

321
00:17:26,440 --> 00:17:29,020
Let's ride to the palace in style!

322
00:17:30,580 --> 00:17:31,410
Yeah!

323
00:17:31,493 --> 00:17:32,780
Pastor Moosey, go!

324
00:17:38,400 --> 00:17:39,230
Hey.

325
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:40,450
Yes?

326
00:17:40,533 --> 00:17:43,880
This is my ball, stowaways! So? Get off!

327
00:17:44,040 --> 00:17:45,317
You're weighing Moosey down!

328
00:17:45,400 --> 00:17:48,753
Oh right, excuse us for not
introducing ourselves sooner.

329
00:17:48,920 --> 00:17:51,744
My name is Jeet and the
big fellow behind me is?

330
00:17:52,200 --> 00:17:53,080
Abdulla, hey!

331
00:17:53,460 --> 00:17:54,377
I didn't ask.

332
00:17:54,460 --> 00:17:55,360
Whoa, whoa!

333
00:17:57,400 --> 00:17:58,720
There you are!

334
00:17:58,980 --> 00:18:00,440
He looks pissed!

335
00:18:00,560 --> 00:18:02,640
I won't let you get near Dolphy!

336
00:18:07,980 --> 00:18:09,820
His arm's growing back.

337
00:18:12,100 --> 00:18:13,520
Mr. Strawhead!

338
00:18:15,820 --> 00:18:17,180
Oh, God!

339
00:18:19,780 --> 00:18:21,300
Grizzly Madness!

340
00:18:25,280 --> 00:18:26,110
Incredible!

341
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:28,560
His head broke!

342
00:18:28,940 --> 00:18:29,920
Or Pika!

343
00:18:35,100 --> 00:18:36,460
Oh, yeah!

344
00:18:38,860 --> 00:18:41,240
We never doubted you, Straw Hat!

345
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:42,757
We knew you should do it!

346
00:18:42,840 --> 00:18:43,670
All right!

347
00:18:44,880 --> 00:18:45,710
Luffy!

348
00:18:45,793 --> 00:18:48,517
I don't think you should be
celebrating just yet, sorry!

349
00:18:48,600 --> 00:18:49,835
He's still out there!

350
00:18:50,280 --> 00:18:53,120
The head you shattered
was just a stone decoy!

351
00:18:53,660 --> 00:18:55,740
So that means Squeaky got away?

352
00:18:56,000 --> 00:18:56,840
Where is he?

353
00:18:57,100 --> 00:18:58,100
He's around here?

354
00:18:58,340 --> 00:18:59,900
His real body's up ahead.

355
00:19:13,460 --> 00:19:16,320
Uh, there's a guy inside the big rock guy?

356
00:19:16,620 --> 00:19:20,267
This is the first time we're
actually seeing him in the flesh.

357
00:19:27,140 --> 00:19:28,820
He's got a huge katana.

358
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:33,221
It's not too late to turn around.

359
00:19:35,940 --> 00:19:38,020
You ever say this too, Moosey?

360
00:19:41,020 --> 00:19:41,850
No!

361
00:19:41,933 --> 00:19:43,020
We're gonna die!

362
00:19:44,040 --> 00:19:44,870
Hey!

363
00:19:48,960 --> 00:19:50,380
Huh? Huh?

364
00:19:50,720 --> 00:19:52,500
The bull can fly?

365
00:19:53,280 --> 00:19:54,110
Hmm?

366
00:19:56,460 --> 00:19:58,440
That voice still gets me!

367
00:19:59,000 --> 00:19:59,920
Mr. Hat!

368
00:20:00,160 --> 00:20:01,360
Here he comes again!

369
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,680
Catch you later!

370
00:20:03,800 --> 00:20:04,630
What the?

371
00:20:07,560 --> 00:20:09,100
Okay, I got this!

372
00:20:09,420 --> 00:20:10,800
Ah, so cool!

373
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:15,720
How dare you!

374
00:20:18,200 --> 00:20:20,280
God, that's such bad-ass friends!

375
00:20:20,600 --> 00:20:21,840
Zoro, be careful!

376
00:20:22,300 --> 00:20:25,124
I'm gonna go give Mingo
the beating he deserves!

377
00:20:25,480 --> 00:20:27,580
You go get him, Captain.

378
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:33,260
I have a score to settle! Move!

379
00:20:33,840 --> 00:20:35,897
You'll have to fight me first.

380
00:20:35,980 --> 00:20:39,627
He has better things to do than
tangle with a pebble like you.

381
00:20:40,900 --> 00:20:42,637
Deal with it, Soprano Man.

382
00:20:42,720 --> 00:20:44,220
I'm all that you've got.

383
00:20:50,600 --> 00:20:54,800
That monster stopped dead in its
tracks! Is he dead? Doubt it.

384
00:20:55,040 --> 00:20:56,569
That's far too convenient.

385
00:20:57,020 --> 00:21:00,857
Regardless, it seems like those annoying
punches of his have ceased for the moment.

386
00:21:00,940 --> 00:21:02,660
So let's strike while we can!

387
00:21:03,260 --> 00:21:06,920
The flamingos shall die by
my hand! No mine! No mine!

388
00:21:15,920 --> 00:21:17,680
You got this, Moosey!

389
00:21:17,820 --> 00:21:19,560
Let's keep it up! Yeah!

390
00:21:19,940 --> 00:21:21,300
Go, Moosey!

391
00:21:21,660 --> 00:21:22,540
Nice work!

392
00:21:22,680 --> 00:21:23,780
Moosey is my wife!

393
00:21:24,080 --> 00:21:26,437
If you want one, then get
off and find your own!

394
00:21:26,520 --> 00:21:27,617
You're such a kidder!

395
00:21:27,700 --> 00:21:29,300
We love you, Straw Hat!

396
00:21:31,880 --> 00:21:38,377
Hey Straw Hat, I realize we have
no choice but to kill do flamingo.

397
00:21:38,460 --> 00:21:40,557
Now that's fine.

398
00:21:40,640 --> 00:21:41,600
I'm ready.

399
00:21:43,560 --> 00:21:44,957
I know that's not the plan.

400
00:21:45,040 --> 00:21:45,977
I suggested before.

401
00:21:46,060 --> 00:21:49,217
I thought we could get away
with a less direct approach.

402
00:21:49,300 --> 00:21:54,777
But to be perfectly honest with you, I
want to make him suffer with my own hands!

403
00:21:54,860 --> 00:21:57,640
I won't let him defeat me again.

404
00:22:05,600 --> 00:22:07,940
It was a person I cared for deeply.

405
00:22:09,020 --> 00:22:10,980
And Doflamigo killed him.

406
00:22:16,820 --> 00:22:18,480
His name was Corazon.

407
00:22:20,040 --> 00:22:23,420
He was a former top executive
in the Don Quixote family.

408
00:22:24,860 --> 00:22:27,036
The Doflamingo killed his own friend?

409
00:22:27,720 --> 00:22:30,460
Corazon was the man who saved my life.

410
00:22:31,280 --> 00:22:36,540
But the Doflamingo, he was more than
just a member of the Don Quixote family.

411
00:22:40,060 --> 00:22:41,820
He was his younger brother.
